# Local Estate runtime boundary:
# Runtime projections, resident/session state, local approvals, attachment
# references, model inventory, validation rollups, dashboards, and indexes are
# regenerated locally and may be sensitive. GitHub is an external crossing; do
# not add live runtime state to source control by default.
runtime/

